{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This free demo lets you experience the first chapter of Grave Whisperers.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Solo or Co-op : Invite up to 3 friends and face the horrors together (1\u20134 players).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice-Controlled Horror \u2013 Test the core mechanic: your microphone is your enemy. Every whisper, breath, or scream can attract the spirit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Haunted Case :\u00a0 Explore and complete objectives in the opening chapter of the cursed pet cemetery. Survive long enough to uncover its secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test Your Courage : Experience the VHS-style visuals, jumpscares, and psychological tension of the full game in a condensed preview.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Please note:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo includes only the first chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version will feature additional haunted cases, new creatures, and expanded mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friends, stay silent, and try to survive the first case of Grave Whisperers.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048130?t=1760368626","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048130?t=1760368626","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048130/35b7de958e52f80fa747aea572027e856354ce1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760368626","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048130/35b7de958e52f80fa747aea572027e856354ce1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760368626","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains scenes of violence, blood, and disturbing imagery. Players may encounter corpses, dark environments, and psychological horror elements. Recommended for mature audiences."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This free demo lets you experience the first chapter of Grave Whisperers.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Solo or Co-op : Invite up to 3 friends and face the horrors together (1\u20134 players).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice-Controlled Horror \u2013 Test the core mechanic: your microphone is your enemy. Every whisper, breath, or scream can attract the spirit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Haunted Case :\u00a0 Explore and complete objectives in the opening chapter of the cursed pet cemetery. Survive long enough to uncover its secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test Your Courage : Experience the VHS-style visuals, jumpscares, and psychological tension of the full game in a condensed preview.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Please note:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo includes only the first chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version will feature additional haunted cases, new creatures, and expanded mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friends, stay silent, and try to survive the first case of Grave Whisperers.</p>","developers":["Digivega Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3970200","name":"Grave Whisperers"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048130/cae1b91bd3fdc23411ab0edc8967b005ac8fee75/header.jpg?t=1760368626","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4048130/994278123/f10f1e9929ea591e76b9f9adc2242fe38fff9af2/1758388536/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760368571","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4048130/994278123/f10f1e9929ea591e76b9f9adc2242fe38fff9af2/1758388536/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760368571","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4048130/994278123/f10f1e9929ea591e76b9f9adc2242fe38fff9af2/1758388536/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760368571","id":257202902,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257202902/movie480.mp4?t=1760368571","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257202902/movie_max.mp4?t=1760368571"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257202902/718bd9e8f0d0960cfbe44d342ea1178d4dbb9508/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760368571","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257202902/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1760368571","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257202902/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1760368571"}}],"name":"Grave Whisperers Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9600K or AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD RX 570 equivalent or greater<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Microph